model: 16-byte lines, write-back cache, RAM initially '.'
  TX coherent      no maintenance   device sends "PACKET-1"
  TX non-coherent  no maintenance   device sends "........"
  TX non-coherent  clean first      device sends "PACKET-1"
  RX coherent      no maintenance   CPU reads    "REPLY-42"
  RX non-coherent  no maintenance   CPU reads    "........"
  RX non-coherent  invalidate after CPU reads    "REPLY-42"
  RX non-coherent, buffer shares a cache line with a counter: RAM bytes 40..47 = "........"
